.name
src/dec/dec-s8-ed25a/dbit.os8
.description
Edusystem 25
This is the corrupted EDU25 source code from dbit.com.
It has blocks which have been corrupted, causing some
of the source code to be over-written.

The file format is the 4-byte format, where each three
characters are packed into two words in OS/8 format,
then each word is padded to 16 bits and stored as a pair
of bytes.
.partnumber
dbit.os8
